ance:** Anthropic has consistently maintained that these details are proprietary[1][2].\n*   **Model Lifecycle:** Claude Opus 4.6 is now considered a legacy model, having been succeeded by newer versions such as Claude Opus 5[10][11].\n\nSources:\n[1] [artificialanalysis.ai](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH7U1PSY1dqyb_oMH8QZvapJJ7r7d7zN_xgfW06EcVilicPmj54HNBUsyJpp-sg7Clu8kdvC9w3rrAm_7pZmPaO3j_aMxnuIVP5yMRlQq3ZRUIQ7cffbqlCOx3ra4iAPqTOVCBUQBNZmw==)\n[2] [artificialanalysis.ai](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEaIGWydpr93JduIz85RA_P0Cs5bTGZwP4piWUfHr-U5O657RVIja08jD4SzSSUa3GEpPg_Z341meWJyRrh4-ZgGL4ctMv144TjZwYk7qYXhLvugt5BJRYmtI8F7nvzf7vcHPP1rUHwPTUi2-WDk2tS6WT5)\n[3] [apxml.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE-Ry_59ZwDk6oDillDOxvov2r_xNV2Bwf1RK3PDVh--yVHTdfFxjTCs4R24IYMeh4TVOTRD30pJtkgEg1qSS8gR4P1qPKMoo87mMW4Cl8U8IIERYH2VF6RjgMNrKA=)\n[4] [buttondown.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG8g2VLCE9e7jw-k4kgXS1kmx9uOYacEnV2piAAKBt69LwR_Wm_JkIb5VPF_Js2CLGQjRa-z_2CBXwulNP65z_o0VRYZpVNtO29eMfiv-F0WPKr2VAylbp-x6_xqf3KGFh2bxiOhVNlX1mjYD_BX6bn6jBSG2PZScTAleRo35vRbWZyn5zaEcRclG4jYGiePAyf)\n[5] [holter.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHvcd3qZJT5zy5jOhnmojFe08RezegJiHREXwBQMXHtZScNSaUeLeSue05ISKKfZBHqTryC8jA8fcb33CCp3j24FY6kS9ubBGD69f3JFXLFESnlLXJr8Ia3YmoXb3ZS2kKM6MvVwtKEdMyMFDf2o3G7UCM73hg1b7qzXsF9RXY7OD3dKQ==)\n[6] [substack.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF1YzL7HTfdAlnaFbj6b1mIFgUzxtltJzY3rIWN4188h7hbQhUqEYDat_kP1i0R3AeHVQpxnCaeteQD5AgnyyTT4BuAx6KoiSpafgaAAeLdHxF23TNdjlrKgCqFXJtg12-XnUGy9yQQSoa510izHiyOI9_mU82n4CDEvOcfIsa77A==)\n[7] [ycombinator.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGDMH2LR9HxT1_UVvl0ypm0JBRtTzLmvM-_m24dF6yOAwka17J_kUwxPuRZRrm33MjWo-U35sC1JTxXg8EIj7C1QnZsrza-kXlT-9TXl2C8NJbPkR3IHY3p7ib0Heop5jYIrw